BT 0.08 0.16 0.27 rg /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 525.89 Tm (1. Deployment principles) Tj ET
0.12 0.39 0.65 RG 1.3 w 54 519.89 m 130 519.89 l S
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 499.89 Tm (Deploy the API, web application, PostgreSQL database, Redis realtime backplane, and file storage as) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 485.89 Tm (separate operational concerns. Keep environment secrets outside source control. Build once, promote) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 471.89 Tm (the same verified artifact between environments, and run database changes before enabling code that) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.89 Tm (depends on them.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 436.89 Tm (The current repository includes managed development workflows for the API and web application. Docker) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 422.89 Tm (and Kubernetes are recommended production packaging strategies, but their manifests should be treated) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 408.89 Tm (as release engineering deliverables and reviewed against the current repository before use.) Tj ET
BT 0.08 0.16 0.27 rg /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 373.89 Tm (2. Environment model) Tj ET
0.12 0.39 0.65 RG 1.3 w 54 367.89 m 130 367.89 l S
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 347.89 Tm (- Development: local or Replit workspace, seeded data, verbose operational feedback, no) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 333.89 Tm (  production credentials.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 312.89 Tm (- Staging: production-like database version, representative data shape, masked data, full) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 298.89 Tm (  smoke and authorization testing.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 277.89 Tm (- Production: isolated database and secret scope, restricted network access, backups,) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 263.89 Tm (  monitoring, and controlled releases.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 242.89 Tm (Do not point development or staging code at a production database. Use a separate `DATABASE_URL` for) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 228.89 Tm (every environment.) Tj ET
BT 0.08 0.16 0.27 rg /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 193.89 Tm (3. Required configuration) Tj ET
0.12 0.39 0.65 RG 1.3 w 54 187.89 m 130 187.89 l S
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 167.89 Tm (Variable | Purpose | Guidance) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 148.89 Tm (DATABASE_URL | PostgreSQL connection | Use a private, TLS-capable production connection) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 129.89 Tm (SESSION_SECRET | JWT and MFA key material | Generate a long random value and store it in a secret) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 115.89 Tm (manager) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 96.89 Tm (REDIS_PASSWORD | Included Redis service authentication | Required by Compose and Kubernetes Redis;) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 82.89 Tm (store it as a secret) Tj ET
0.78 0.81 0.84 RG 0.5 w 54 38 m 541.28 38 l S
