BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 775.89 Tm (REDIS_URL | Redis 7 connection for the Socket.IO adapter | Required in production; include the) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 761.89 Tm (matching credential and store the complete URL as a secret) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.00 742.89 Tm (PORT | API listen port | Use the platform-provided port; current development API defaults to 8080) Tj ET
