BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.89 Tm (The application must start with `SESSION_SECRET` set because MFA encryption intentionally fails) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 671.89 Tm (closed without it. A production API also fails startup when `REDIS_URL` is absent, because Redis is) Tj ET
