BT 0.28 0.33 0.39 rg /F2 7.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 807.89 Tm (NEXUS HMS DEPLOYMENT STRATEGY) Tj ET
0.12 0.39 0.65 RG 1 w 54 798.89 m 541.28 798.89 l S
BT 0.08 0.16 0.27 rg /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 761.89 Tm (6. Container strategy) Tj ET
0.12 0.39 0.65 RG 1.3 w 54 755.89 m 130 755.89 l S
BT 0.12 0.39 0.65 rg /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 727.89 Tm (API image) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 708.89 Tm (Use a multi-stage Node image. The build stage installs workspace dependencies, compiles the shared) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 694.89 Tm (database package, and builds the API. The runtime stage contains production dependencies and compiled) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 680.89 Tm (output only. Run `node dist/main.js`, expose the configured API port, and use a non-root user where) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 666.89 Tm (the base image policy permits.) Tj ET
BT 0.12 0.39 0.65 rg /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 637.89 Tm (Web image) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 618.89 Tm (Build the Next.js application with the configured standalone output when enabled. The runtime image) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 604.89 Tm (should contain the standalone server and static assets only. Expose the web port and pass the API) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 590.89 Tm (origin through deployment configuration rather than baking a development URL into source.) Tj ET
BT 0.12 0.39 0.65 rg /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 561.89 Tm (Compose) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 542.89 Tm (The Compose stacks include PostgreSQL where appropriate, Redis 7, API, and web services with health) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 528.89 Tm (checks, restart behavior, and a private service network. Redis starts with `--requirepass`;) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 514.89 Tm (`REDIS_PASSWORD` and the password in the API's `REDIS_URL` must match. Redis health checks) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 500.89 Tm (authenticate. Redis provides the Socket.IO backplane only: cache and EventEmitter2 remain) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 486.89 Tm (process-local, and uploads remain on the local Compose volume. These internal Compose connections use) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.89 Tm (`redis://`, not TLS, and are not the recommended Redis topology for real production.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 451.89 Tm (The API container smoke gate starts PostgreSQL 16 and password-protected Redis 7, authenticates the) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 437.89 Tm (Redis readiness check, starts two production API containers with credential-bearing Redis URLs,) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 423.89 Tm (checks `/api/health` on both, and verifies that uid 1000 can write to the shared mounted upload) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 409.89 Tm (volume.) Tj ET
BT 0.08 0.16 0.27 rg /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.89 Tm (7. Kubernetes strategy) Tj ET
0.12 0.39 0.65 RG 1.3 w 54 368.89 m 130 368.89 l S
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 348.89 Tm (Use a namespace per environment or a clearly isolated release boundary. Recommended resources:) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 327.89 Tm (- API Deployment with three replicas and an HPA ranging from two to ten replicas.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 306.89 Tm (- Web Deployment with at least two replicas for workstation availability.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 285.89 Tm (- Redis 7 Deployment and ClusterIP Service for the Socket.IO adapter.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 264.89 Tm (- ClusterIP Services for API and web.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 243.89 Tm (- Ingress with TLS and an approved hostname.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 222.89 Tm (- Readiness and liveness probes on `/api/health`.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 201.89 Tm (- CPU and memory requests and limits.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 180.89 Tm (- HPA based on CPU plus application metrics where appropriate.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 159.89 Tm (- Secret objects or an external secret provider for `DATABASE_URL` and `SESSION_SECRET`.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 138.89 Tm (- A 10Gi ReadWriteOnce uploads PVC.) Tj ET
