0.12 0.39 0.65 RG 1.3 w 54 755.89 m 130 755.89 l S
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 735.89 Tm (Monitor health checks, request totals and duration, active WebSocket connections, cache hit/miss) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 721.89 Tm (ratios, database pool pressure, application errors, and authentication failures. Back up PostgreSQL) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 707.89 Tm (on a schedule aligned with the hotel recovery point objective and test restoration.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 686.89 Tm (For rollback, stop promotion of the current artifact, deploy the last verified application image, and) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 672.89 Tm (only roll back the database when the migration is explicitly reversible and the data impact is) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 658.89 Tm (understood. If the database migration is additive, prefer a forward-compatible application rollback) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 644.89 Tm (rather than destructive reversal.) Tj ET
BT 0.08 0.16 0.27 rg /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.89 Tm (11. Production checklist) Tj ET
